words": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TXX7r_uzhSEQ7kNvwEdNWvO&_nc_oc=Adm77fOd1U9mX0ExSwtzzHxdQTiLfMFuvIV2EeuIZpsIK3-se3FLuuleZSQ8R_6K-Do&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy8UHvsT8Zt0Axz0VA4meM337vETasH8irNs4aD7Y-_AQ&oe=69B41041"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rXQy1paqPbIQ7kNvwFo6so9&_nc_oc=AdkARKRYakNZFOlsuYXwR5RnLIAJKqIYcpC0qK0M-c0jDErlL5mwsyw-AR1CfQ3AnE8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyaBsEsgEbH1cczztzINyHUcz0KZY64l_bY6bMlGqfNMw&oe=69B404B3"}, {"file_name": "Cover-Square.png", "id": "811623013181900", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974629_811623016515233_3126397619395326849_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r1n7xSjE3EsQ7kNvwEpT_7U&_nc_oc=AdnIlDm9TTh5O4bNXmemI8CtJp3wKTy1nJfIyboiFyPq5bnWmVUTBZ9W